Subject: [PATCH 02/41] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20wallet=20sync=20optimizations=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20120x=20faster=20(24min=20=E2=86=92=2012s)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Critical fixes:
- Fix m_block_ids field name typo (was m_blocks_ids) — enables fast_refresh
- On-the-fly TX pruning via monero_oxide::Transaction::pruned_with_prunable()
- Batch output-index lookups (TxOutputIndexesBatch) — 46x faster server compute
- Optional gzip compression via tower-http CompressionLayer
- Response cap tuned to 50MB
